    "name": "blog-audio",
    "description": "Generate audio narration of blog posts using Google Gemini TTS. Supports summary narration, full article read-aloud, and two-speaker podcast/dialogue mode with 30 voice options. Outputs MP3 with HTML5 audio embed code. Works standalone via /blog audio or internally from blog-write. Falls back gracefully when API key is not configured. Use when user says \"blog audio\", \"narrate blog\", \"audio version\", \"text to speech\", \"tts\", \"podcast mode\", \"read aloud\", \"audio narration\", \"voice\", \"narration\", \"generate audio\".\n",
